config GPIO_LOONGSON_LS2K0300
	bool "Loongson LS2K0300 GPIO driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_LOONGSON_LS2K0300_GPIO_ENABLED
	help
	  Driver for the "byte controlled" GPIO block of the Loongson 2K0300
	  (and compatible 2K series SoCs), register layout as in the mainline
	  Linux driver drivers/gpio/gpio-loongson-64bit.c. Interrupt support
	  is not implemented yet.
